		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Huge female giant with violet skin, insectoid legs, and bee antennae. Thriae are oracles. Require breeding with humanoid males to fertilize eggs. Recruits local males to live a captive life of leisure.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 57, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 mace +9 (2d6) or spawn swarm, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Merope</strong>. The queen is coated in merope, thriae honey. 3:6 chance hostile spells are reflected back at their originator.</p><p></p><p><strong>Spawn Swarm</strong>. Spawn 1d4 wasp swarms that protect the queen for 5 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
